  "method_note": "The refseq_gd_projinit_* experiments, and the gd_alpha / gd_lr / gd_steps / gd_controls groups they live in, keep their historical names so they still map to the archived rows in data/phase2/results/task2_runs.csv. Their method is 'probe_repr' (phase2/unlearn_probe_repr.py), which is the objective that actually produced them. 'gd' now means classic cross-entropy gradient difference (phase2/unlearn_gd.py), which produced the lora_gd_* runs in phase2/sweep_configs/lora_full_grid.json. The 'gd' and 'probe_repr' selector aliases are equivalent here; prefer 'probe_repr'. See docs/RESULTS.md."
